<title>UK: UBS leads three-tranche asset-backed FRN for Acres.</title>
<headline>UBS leads three-tranche asset-backed FRN for Acres.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ACRES NO 3 PLC</p>
<p>BACKED BY COMMERCIAL MORTGAGES ORIGINATED BY</p>
<p>	     UNITED BANK OF KUWAIT</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    97.81 MLN STG BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JUN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  99.92     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	AVG LIFE 4.15 YEARS</p>
<p>CLASS M1</p>
<p> AMT    14.14 MLN STG BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    29.JUN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +40 BP    PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.92     FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	AVG LIFE 4.99 YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO CLASS M2 NOTES OF 5.89 MLN STG,</p>
<p>		PAYING 3M LIBOR +62.5 AT 99.92, RATED BAA2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
